Defect found: **instrument reading a different predicate than the one being checked**.

Line 55-60: the control for “pooled point” checks only whether `results.by_outcome` is non-empty, while the real count at line 100-101 requires `pooled.point is not None`.

Exact input:
```python
{"results": {"by_outcome": {"p": {}}}}
```

Consequence: the control can report that pooled-point detection is covered even though this object has no pooled point and would produce `len(pooled) == 0` in the real code.

Defect found: **selector keyed to a narrower form than valid HTML filenames**.

